ros-jazzy-serial (1.2.1-1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Package the ROS 2 port of wjwwood/serial for ROS 2 Jazzy.
  * Base on upstream wjwwood/serial main (69e0372).
  * Build with ament_cmake; install headers, shared library and ament
    metadata under the configured install prefix (default /opt/roboparty).

